    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The price of a bag is first increased by $20%$ and then decreased by $20%$.$ Find the net percentage change in the price of the bag.",
    "question_zh": "手袋的價錢先增加 $20%$，然後減少 $20%$。求該手袋價錢的淨百分比變化。",
    "options": [
      "A. $20%$",
      "B. $20%$ increase (增加)",
      "C. $20%$ decrease (減少)",
      "D. $20%$ increase (增加)"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let the original price be $P$.$",
      "Price after increase $= P(1 + $20%$) = 1.2P$.$",
      "Price after decrease $= 1.2P(1 - $20%$) = 1.2P(0.8) = 0.96P$.$",
      "Percentage change $= (0.96 - 1) \\times $20%$ = -$20%$.$",
      "This represents a $20%$ decrease."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設原價為 $P$。",
      "增加後的價錢 $= P(1 + $20%$) = 1.2P$。",
      "減少後的價錢 $= 1.2P(1 - $20%$) = 1.2P(0.8) = 0.96P$。",
      "百分比變化 $= (0.96 - 1) \\times $20%$ = -$20%$。",
      "即減少了 $20%$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "percentage-change",
      "successive-change"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_292",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "math_num_percentages",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
