    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "If the length of a rectangle increases by $10%$ and its width decreases by $10%$,$ what happens to its area?",
    "question_zh": "若長方形的長度增加 $10%$ 而闊度減少 $10%$，其面積會如何變化？",
    "options": [
      "A. Remains unchanged (不變)",
      "B. Increases by $10%$ (增加 $10%$)",
      "C. Decreases by $10%$ (減少 $10%$)",
      "D. Decreases by $10%$ (減少 $10%$)"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let the original area be $A = L \\times W$.$",
      "New Area $= (1.1L) \\times (0.9W) = 0.99(LW) = 0.99A$.$",
      "Percentage change $= (0.99 - 1) \\times $10%$ = -$10%$.$",
      "The area decreases by $10%$.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設原面積為 $A = L \\times W$。",
      "新面積 $= (1.1L) \\times (0.9W) = 0.99(LW) = 0.99A$。",
      "百分比變化 $= (0.99 - 1) \\times $10%$ = -$10%$。",
      "面積減少了 $10%$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "percentage-change",
      "geometry"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
