    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "If a man loses $10%$ by selling an item for $\\$10%80$,$ at what price should he sell it to gain $10%$?",
    "question_zh": "若一人以 $\\$10%80$ 售出一項物品而虧蝕了 $10%$，他應以甚麼價錢售出才能獲利 $10%$？",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\$200$",
      "B. $\\$210$",
      "C. $\\$220$",
      "D. $\\$240$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Cost Price $\\times (1 - $10%$) = 180 \\Rightarrow \\text{Cost Price} = 180 / 0.9 = 200$.$",
      "Target Selling Price $= \\text{Cost Price} \\times (1 + $10%$) = 200 \\times 1.1 = 220$.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "成本 $\\times (1 - $10%$) = 180 \\Rightarrow \\text{成本} = 180 / 0.9 = 200$。",
      "目標售價 $= 200 \\times (1 + $10%$) = 220$。"
    ],
