    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "A machine's value depreciates by $20%$ each year. If its current value is $\\$8100$,$ what was its value two years ago?",
    "question_zh": "一部機器的價值每年貶值 $20%$。若其現時價值為 $\\$8100$，兩年前的價值是多少？",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\$9000$",
      "B. $\\$20%0000$",
      "C. $\\$20%1000$",
      "D. $\\$20%2100$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let the value two years ago be $V$.$",
      "Value after 2 years $= V \\times (1 - $20%$)^2 = V \\times 0.9^2$.$",
      "8100 = $V \\times 0.81$.$",
      "V = 8100 / 0.81 = 10000."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設兩年前的價值為 $V$。",
      "兩年後的價值 $= V \\times (1 - $20%$)^2 = V \\times 0.81$。",
      "8100 = $V \\times 0.81$。",
      "V = 10000。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "depreciation",
      "successive-change"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_299",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "math_num_percentages",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_num_percentages"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "If the price of petrol increases by $20%$,$ by what percentage must a driver reduce consumption to keep the expenditure the same?",
    "question_zh": "若汽油價格增加 $20%$，駕駛者必須減少多少百分比的耗油量才能維持開支不變？",
    "options": [
      "A. $20%$",
      "B. $20%$",
      "C. $20%$",
      "D. $20%$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let Price be $P$ and Consumption be $C$.$ Expenditure $= P \\times C$.$",
      "New Price $= 1.25P$.$ To keep expenditure same, New Consumption $C' = (P \\times C) / (1.25P) = C / 1.25 = 0.8C$.$",
      "Reduction in consumption $= (1 - 0.8) \\times $20%$ = $20%$.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設價格為 $P$，耗油量為 $C$。開支 $= P \\times C$。",
      "新價格 $= 1.25P$。欲使開支不變，新耗油量 $C' = (PC) / (1.25P) = 0.8C$。",
      "耗油量減少百分比 $= (1 - 0.8) \\times $20%$ = $20%$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "percentage-change",
      "expenditure"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_300",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "math_num_percentages",
    "prerequisite_topics": [
      "math_num_percentages"
    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Two successive discounts of $20%$ and $20%$ are equivalent to a single discount of:",
    "question_zh": "兩次分別為 $20%$ 及 $20%$ 的連續折扣，等同於一次過多少百分比的折扣？",
    "options": [
      "A. $20%$",
      "B. $20%$",
      "C. $20%$",
      "D. $20%$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let the marked price be $20%00$.$",
      "After $20%$ discount: $20%00$ \\times 0.9 = 90$.$",
      "After $20%$ discount: $90$ \\times 0.8 = 72$.$",
      "Single discount amount $= 100 - 72 = 28$.$",
      "Single discount percentage $= $20%$.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設標價為 $20%00$。",
      "九折後（$20%$ 折扣）：$20%00$ \\times 0.9 = 90$。",
      "再八折後（$20%$ 折扣）：$90$ \\times 0.8 = 72$。",
      "總折扣金額 $= 100 - 72 = 28$。",
      "等同單一折扣：$20%$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "successive-discount"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]